{"transcript":"ˌæntɪməˈkæsərz","exists":true,"definitions":["A small cover, usually ornamental, placed on the backs or arms of chairs or sofas to prevent soiling of the permanent fabric."],"examples":["The antimacassars protected the velvet.","She crocheted delicate antimacassars.","Dust settled on the antimacassars."],"lemma":"antimacassar","lemmaPos":"noun","synonyms":["doily","cover","protector"],"number":"plural","pluralForm":"antimacassars","source":"antimacassars"}